bb-plugin-media-inspector
=========================

Calls two external binaries as tools: exiftool (Perl, Artistic-2.0) and
ffprobe/ffmpeg (LGPL/GPL). Neither is bundled, linked or copied; the plugin
spawns them and reads their JSON.

The approach follows the agy-media-inspector plugin authored for Antigravity
CLI on this machine. This plugin's TypeScript implementation is new; no
Python source was copied.

Everything in this repository is MIT, original work by prismatic7.
